{
  "slug": "claude-jira-skill",
  "name": "Claude Jira Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Jira integration for Claude Code — fetch tickets, search with JQL, create and update issues, assign, transition, link, comment, and generate team digest reports. Works with Jira Cloud and self-hosted instances.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `jira` (Access Jira to search, summarize, and analyze tickets) and **1 hook**, `SessionStart`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-jira-skill@claude-community` from `illarion/claude-jira-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that provides full Jira integration — fetch tickets, search with JQL, manage issues, and generate team digest reports.",
